<BaseLayout title="About — BulldogsManila" description="BulldogsManila is a living family notebook: a permanent home for the pack’s stories.">
  <article class="page-hero wrap prose-page"><p class="eyebrow">About this home</p><h1>The internet moves quickly. A family does not have to.</h1><p class="lede">BulldogsManila is a living notebook for Bacon, Beer, Bao Bao, and Bowser.</p><p>Social channels carry moments out into the world. This site keeps the full stories together: the funny routines, the quiet changes, the things worth remembering, and the particular texture of home.</p><h2>A Fur-rental Note</h2><p>Every story begins with the pack’s real life at home. Some visuals or editing may be assisted by AI, but no tool can invent the memories, mischief, or heart that make them BulldogsManila stories.</p><p>And yes—Beer is the dog’s name.</p></article>
